<title>JAPAN: Lion - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Lion - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		155.04		vs	  149.41</p>
<p> Operating	  797    million    vs	  698    million</p>
<p> Current		3.12		vs	    3.09</p>
<p> Net		    2.56		vs	    2.15</p>
<p> EPS		    8.27 yen	  vs	    7.22 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    309 million	  vs	 299 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Lion Corp is a major producer of household goods.</p>
